WEBVTT

00:00:00.106 --> 00:00:05.889
Sending a notification

00:00:05.939 --> 00:00:11.917
Open Notifications and switch to the Send tab. Broadcast to Group is selected.

00:00:18.460 --> 00:00:21.729
Choose a template to fill in the title and message.

00:00:25.059 --> 00:00:30.363
Choose the group, here All Teachers. The channel stays In-App.

00:00:31.426 --> 00:00:37.839
Press Review and Send Broadcast, check the number of recipients, and press Confirm Send.

00:00:44.175 --> 00:00:48.841
Notification sent
